I suggest you to launch a pro version of the app with work management tools included. I belief it will be quite useful to pro users like me. Here you are some of the features to include in the pro version:

- geographical notifications so that users can be notified about a note whenever arrives in a certain region (or in certain regions);
- text (and other itens) tagged as field so that they can be content transversal to several notes and automatically updatable from any of the notes;
- better table features like in a professional text processor app;
- as many project management tools as possible;
- etc.

I LOVE Notes. I use it every day! I put in it:

1. All the books I’ve read;
2. Movies I want to watch on Netflix, Prime Video and Hulu;
3. Things I need to buy at a store;
4. My bucket list;
5. Important information I don’t have memorized and SO MUCH MORE!
